 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Degree-one element associated to an ideal element",
 "statement": "Every $a\\in I$ determines a homogeneous element $at$ of degree one. Its\nunderlying polynomial and its coefficient in degree one are recorded by\nsimp lemmas.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-def-nagata-sketch-data/lemma-nagata-rees-degree-one-element.md",
